  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0: Initial release. A standalone HTTP/1.1 listener (raw System.Net.Sockets.TcpListener, no Kestrel, no OWIN) so WinForms/WPF/console apps with no ASP.NET Core pipeline of their own can still serve the Nafas dashboard, on its own configurable port, with a LocalhostOnly/Lan access-mode switch. Requires Nafas.Observability 0.1.2+.",
